.TH FORGEKIT-ADD 1 "2026-08-25" "ForgeKit 0.3.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
forgekit-add \- Add a feature to an existing ForgeKit project
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B forgekit add
[\fIfeature\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a feature to an existing ForgeKit project. Features extend the project
with additional capabilities such as authentication, CORS, logging, or
Swagger/OpenAPI documentation.

Features can declare dependencies on other features, which are automatically
resolved and installed first.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-list
List all available features with versions and descriptions
.TP
.B \-\-plan
Show the installation plan without making changes (files to create/modify/delete, conflicts, dependencies)
.TP
.B \-\-dry-run
Alias for \fI\-\-plan\fR
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable debug output
.TP
.B \-\-format \fIformat\fR
Output format: human, json (default: human)
.TP
.B \-\-quiet
Reduce output (except errors and JSON)
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
List available features:
.B forgekit add --list
.TP
Preview auth feature installation:
.B forgekit add auth --plan
.TP
Install auth feature:
.B forgekit add auth
.TP
Install with JSON output:
.B forgekit add auth --format json
.SH FEATURES
.TP
.B auth
JWT authentication infrastructure (middleware, token validation)
.TP
.B cors
CORS middleware for cross-origin requests (depends on auth)
.TP
.B logging
Structured logging and HTTP middleware (depends on auth)
.TP
.B swagger
OpenAPI/Swagger documentation (depends on cors)
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success
.TP
.B 1
Feature not found, dependency conflict, or project not a ForgeKit project
.TP
.B 2
Execution error
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ./.forge/features.yaml
Installed features tracking (updated)
.TP
.I ./forge.yaml
Project configuration (may be updated)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR forgekit (1),
.BR forgekit-remove (1),
.BR forgekit-doctor (1)
.SH AUTHOR
ForgeKit Contributors <forgekit@demetrius-ch.github.io>